id = &"hunger"
display_name = "Hunger"
description = "Hunger (0-100) rises by 1 per 1% of max HP lost and 1 per second in combat. At 100 Butler is Starving for up to 8 s: his kit turns into Claws, Bite, Pounce and Hiss. Each Bite lowers Hunger by 35; at 0 he straightens his tie (rooted 0.6 s), then gains bonus armor for 3 s."
